.* root directory of this project.
.*
.* QUICHGSV: WRKSYSVAL option 2, a system value changed in place. CHGSV
.* takes one value, CHGSVL a list of them (library lists, the values
.* that hold several words); the driver applies them with CHGSYSVAL.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ELEMCL BASETYPE='CHAR 15'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SVNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SVVALUE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SVELEM CLASS=ELEMCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=ELEMS VARS='SVELEM'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CHGSV KEYL=KEYS HELP=CHGSVH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Change System Value
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAI VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.System value
:DATAI VAR=SVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:DATAI VAR=SVTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type choice, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=SVVALUE USAGE=INOUT CSRLOC.Value
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=CHGSVL KEYL=KEYS HELP=CHGSVLH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Change System Value
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAI VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.System value
:DATAI VAR=SVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:DATAI VAR=SVTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type choices, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ELEMS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=SVELEM USAGE=INOUT.Value
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=CHGSVH.Change System Value - Help
:P.Type the new value and press Enter; the value is checked and set
as CHGSYSVAL would set it. Some values take effect at the next IPL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGSVLH.Change System Value - Help
:P.The value is a list: type, change or blank its elements in order
and press Enter. Blank entries are dropped.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 shows the value as it is now; F3 and F12 leave without changing
it.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
